 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Book and order",
   "texto": [
    "**Забронировать** (booking) goes with the accusative supplement: **забронировать номер** (booking a room). With **хотел бы** (I would like): **Я хотел бы забронировать номер** (I would like to book a room).",
    "**На двоих** means «for two»: **номер на двоих** (room for two). For three: **на троих**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "View and price",
   "texto": [
    "**С видом на** + accusative means «with a view to»: **с видом на море** (with sea views). To ask the time of a flight you say **Во сколько вылет?** (what time does the flight come out?).",
    "**Сколько стоит ночь?** (how much is the night?) is the most common question at the hotel."
   ]
  },
